{block beforeContent}
<div class="container">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-12">
            <div class="p-5 text-white bg-dark">
                <h3>Download dataset</h3>
                <p class="lead">Please, fill the form below, so we can send the download link to your e-mail.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
{/block}

{block content}
<p>Here you can request a download of anonymized type-1 database with artificially calculated blood glucose levels. This database is free to use for non-profit, academic research only, but cannot be redistributed freely. Only the URL, https://diabetes.zcu.cz, can be redistributed, from where the database can be downloaded.</p>
<p>When publishing any results obtained with this database, you must include the following citations:</p>
<p><i>We have used a database with diabetes type-1 completely anonymized CGMS profiles, which is available as a part of the SmartCGMS project [1]. This database has been enriched with artificially calculated blood glucose levels [2].<ol><li>T. Koutny and M. Ubl, "SmartCGMS as a Testbed for a Blood-Glucose Level Prediction and/or Control Challenge with (an FDA-Accepted) Diabetic Patient Simulation", Procedia Computer Science, Volume 177, pp. 354-362, 2020</i></li><li>I. De Falco, A. Della Cioppa, A. Giugliano, A. Marcelli, T. Koutny, M. Krcma, U. Scafuri, E. Tarantino, "A Genetic Programming-based Regression for Extrapolating a Blood Glucose-Dynamics Model from Interstitial Glucose Measurements and their Derivatives", Submitted to the Applied Soft Computing Journal, 2018</li></ol></i></p>

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-12">
        {form requestDownloadForm}
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12">
                {label name /}
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12 form-group">
                {input name class=>'form-control'}
                <div class="space-1em"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12">
                {label phone /}
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12 form-group">
                {input phone class=>'form-control'}
                <div class="space-1em"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12">
                {label address /}
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12 form-group">
                {input address class=>'form-control'}
                <div class="space-1em"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12">
                {label email /}
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12 form-group">
                {input email class=>'form-control'}
                <div class="space-1em"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12 form-group">
                <div class="d-grid gap-2">
                    {input submit class=>'btn btn-dark btn-lg'}
                </div>
                <div class="space-1em"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        {/form}
    </div>
</div>
